    "sends today. aidaAdminContract.test.ts asserts this service accepts each",
    "one unchanged, so a drift on either side fails a test rather than a call.",
    "Nullable fields appear as null, not omitted, because AidaAdmin types them",
    "as `string | null` and sends the null through.",
    "identityUserId is absent by design: AidaAdmin resolves user/extension",
    "presentation before provisioning and OfficePulse never requires it."
